OL,3,GNEWSAWoman denies lying about suspected
OL,4,Amurder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has denied assisting a murder
OL,7,Fsuspect and lying to police.
OL,9,FKarl Skoulding, 43, was found with stab
OL,10,Fwounds in Bury St Edmunds, Suffolk in
OL,11,FApril 2022 and a woman was treated in
OL,12,Fhospital for injuries.
OL,14,FChloe Carr, 36, of Hunston Road,
OL,15,FChichester, West Sussex, has appeared
OL,16,Fat Ipswich Crown Court and denied
OL,17,Fmaking false statements to the police
OL,18,Fand alerting Emmanuel Kofi-Sarpong that
OL,19,Fhis stabbing of Skoulding had resulted
OL,20,Fin his death at Harland Court in Bury.
